<title>USA: United Medicorp names Seaman chairman.</title>
<headline>United Medicorp names Seaman chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Medicorp Inc said on Tuesday its president and chief executive, Peter Seaman, has also taken on the duties of chairman.</p>
<p>Seaman, 47, succeeds Otis Winters in that position.</p>
